OL,3,GNEWSAWest Highland Line closed for nine
OL,4,Adays for #13m upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe West Highland Line has been closed
OL,7,Ffor nine days for a #13m upgrade.
OL,9,FThe scenic railway line, linking
OL,10,FGlasgow to destinations including Oban
OL,11,Fand Mallaig, features the famous
OL,12,FGlenfinnan Viaduct seen in the Harry
OL,13,FPotter films.
OL,15,FNetwork Rail will carry out work at
OL,16,Flocations between Helensburgh, Fort
OL,17,FWilliam and Mallaig.
OL,19,FIt said the work would tackle wear and
OL,20,Ftear, make the route more resilient in
OL,21,Fperiods of severe weather and reduce
OL,22,Fthe risk of delays and restrictions.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
